{title: Raat Di Gedi}
{artist: Diljit Dosanjh}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
Ho [Am] raat di gedi gal [G] risk di,        [F] Taang chhidi aa [Am] tere ishq di..
O jatt [Am] rauleya ?ch ghoome [G] balliye,        Har [F] chowk hathyar bandh [G] jhalliye
Light [Em] mitran de Bullet de [F] lishk di,        Ho tere [Am] piche nitt aavaan
Raat [F] jaag ke langawaan,        Ni tu [Em] neendran handaawe
Te main [Am] risk handawaan?        Yaar [Am] ghumme tareyaan de cha [G] an?ne
Kaah ton hera [F] pheri haan? [G] ne,        Jave [Em] dekh ke banereya ton [F] khiskdi ho
Ho [Am] raat di gedi gal [G] risk di,        [F] Taang chhidi aa [Am] tere ishq di..
Ho [Am] pyaar tera mutiyaare,        Te lokan [F] taku ae shing [G] aare
Ni qissa [Em] vigde maahol da,        Ranb [Am] ir ho ju laare
Ho tenu [Am] milna daleri waala [G] masla,        Lok haat [F] heya najaiz asl [G] aa
Dekh haan [Em] ne thitiri na [F] sisak di ho
